## Verified custom domains of OpenVibe.Host tenants — generated by `ovhost nginx tenants {{service}}`
##
## Source: host_domains rows with kind = 'custom' AND status = 'verified' in {{database}}, read
## read-only as the service user. {{withCert}} domain(s) have a certificate and are served over HTTPS;
## {{withoutCert}} wait for one (HTTP answers only the ACME challenge until the operator issues it:
##   certbot certonly --webroot -w /var/www/certbot -d <hostname>
## then run this command again). Certificates and keys are never read or printed here.
